<h3>Vision of Collapse</h3>
<p>
    The Magus Dam is being attacked by Elementals! Kill the elementals and save the workers before it all collapses around them.
</p>
<p>
    The first area of the Dam is filled with water. Kill the water elemental to open the doors to the next section.
</p>
<p>
    The second area has an earth elemental and an air elemental. Drag them both together so you can cleave them both.
</p>
<p>
    The third area has a pair of earth elemental hands. Defeat them to finish the Vision.
</p>
<p>
    Each area also has 3 workers that must be saved. The 3 in the water can simply be revived by going up to them and pressing F.
    The other 6 (3 in area 2, 3 in area 3) are all trapped by rubble that will need to be destroyed.
</p>